    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The Tallinn City Digital Twin is a high-fidelity virtual replica of the city developed in collaboration with the Tallinn Strategic Management Office (Tallinna Strateegiakeskus). Now officially handed over to the city and still in active development, the platform serves as a primary foundation for smarter, data-driven urban governance.",
      "html": "The Tallinn City Digital Twin is a high-fidelity virtual replica of the city developed in collaboration with the <strong>Tallinn Strategic Management Office</strong> (<strong>Tallinna Strateegiakeskus</strong>). Now officially handed over to the city and still in active development, the platform serves as a primary foundation for smarter, data-driven urban governance.",
      "tag": "p",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontFamily": "Inter",
      "color": "rgb(102, 102, 102)",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
