    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "This project provides an interactive 3D map of Tallinn featuring embedded city data and precise mappings of underground infrastructure, including water and electricity networks, for civilian workers such as excavators and city planners. The system incorporates AI-driven monitoring to prioritize and report city faults, and real-time infrastructure maintenance.",
      "html": "This project provides an interactive 3D map of Tallinn featuring embedded city data and precise mappings of underground infrastructure, including water and electricity networks, for civilian workers such as excavators and city planners. The system incorporates AI-driven monitoring to prioritize and report city faults, and real-time infrastructure maintenance.",
